{"3601630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Cosmo Tales", "steam_appid": 3601630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmo Tales is a family-friendly roguelite adventure where you take the wheel of a talking car and journey across a vibrant sci-fi universe full of strange worlds, colorful danger, and ever-changing dimensions. Each run invites you to battle your way through dynamic encounters, discover new upgrades, and craft unique combat builds that suit your own playstyle, whether you prefer fast offense, clever tactics, or adaptable all-round strategies. As the universe shifts around you in unexpected ways, every adventure feels fresh, playful, and full of new possibilities for exploration, experimentation, and action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/d31617ce9b8f0042816c4566f6c47309.poster.avif?t=1787903253\" aria-label=\"Shift Dimensions. Change Everything.\" width=800 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/d31617ce9b8f0042816c4566f6c47309.webm?t=1787903253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/d31617ce9b8f0042816c4566f6c47309.mp4?t=1787903253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <i>Cosmo Tales</i>, a one-of-a-kind family-friendly roguelite from Bohemia Interactive. Jump into fast-paced combat, experiment with your own combat build, and explore a colorful sci-fi universe inspired by retro-futurism, brought to life in the style of a 3D-animated movie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/5101299786e34302b49193408844fab8.poster.avif?t=1787903253\" width=800 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/5101299786e34302b49193408844fab8.webm?t=1787903253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/5101299786e34302b49193408844fab8.mp4?t=1787903253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift dimensions in real time to change both gameplay and the visual feel of the world around you. Every reality offers new tactical possibilities, fresh enemy interactions, and new ways to approach combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face distinctive enemies built around layered defenses and unique combat strategies that push you to adapt, experiment, and think creatively. With every run, you can discover powerful combinations and shape a playstyle that feels truly your own.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/bc3db9992e1646ff8aa936af5c94e993.poster.avif?t=1787903253\" width=800 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/bc3db9992e1646ff8aa936af5c94e993.webm?t=1787903253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/bc3db9992e1646ff8aa936af5c94e993.mp4?t=1787903253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With striking visuals, accessible action, and dimension-shifting gameplay, <i>Cosmo Tales</i> delivers a fresh and playful space adventure for players of all ages.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through universe as a talking car in a family-friendly roguelite space adventure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own unique combat build and adapt your strategy on every run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift dimensions in real time to change both gameplay and the visual style of the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Battle distinctive enemies with layered defenses and unique combat behaviors.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vibrant retro-futuristic universe styled like a colorful 3D-animated movie.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cosmo Tales is a family-friendly roguelite adventure where you take the wheel of a talking car and journey across a vibrant sci-fi universe full of strange worlds, colorful danger, and ever-changing dimensions. Each run invites you to battle your way through dynamic encounters, discover new upgrades, and craft unique combat builds that suit your own playstyle, whether you prefer fast offense, clever tactics, or adaptable all-round strategies. As the universe shifts around you in unexpected ways, every adventure feels fresh, playful, and full of new possibilities for exploration, experimentation, and action.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/d31617ce9b8f0042816c4566f6c47309.poster.avif?t=1787903253\" aria-label=\"Shift Dimensions. Change Everything.\" width=800 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/d31617ce9b8f0042816c4566f6c47309.webm?t=1787903253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/d31617ce9b8f0042816c4566f6c47309.mp4?t=1787903253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into <i>Cosmo Tales</i>, a one-of-a-kind family-friendly roguelite from Bohemia Interactive. Jump into fast-paced combat, experiment with your own combat build, and explore a colorful sci-fi universe inspired by retro-futurism, brought to life in the style of a 3D-animated movie.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/5101299786e34302b49193408844fab8.poster.avif?t=1787903253\" width=800 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/5101299786e34302b49193408844fab8.webm?t=1787903253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/5101299786e34302b49193408844fab8.mp4?t=1787903253\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shift dimensions in real time to change both gameplay and the visual feel of the world around you. Every reality offers new tactical possibilities, fresh enemy interactions, and new ways to approach combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face distinctive enemies built around layered defenses and unique combat strategies that push you to adapt, experiment, and think creatively. With every run, you can discover powerful combinations and shape a playstyle that feels truly your own.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/bc3db9992e1646ff8aa936af5c94e993.poster.avif?t=1787903253\" width=800 height=550 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3601630/extras/bc3db9992e1646ff8aa936af5c94e993.webm?t=1787903253\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.stea